- **Accidental Ingestion:** Do not induce vomiting. Perform gastric lavage or administer activated charcoal if ingestion is recent. Provide symptomatic and supportive care. Monitor for signs of systemic selenium toxicity.', '- Store at room temperature between 15°C and 30°C (59°F and 86°F).
- Protect from excessive heat and freezing.
