- Elevated bilirubin and alkaline phosphatase
- Severe skin reactions (SJS, TEN, AGEP)', 'C', '**Fetal Risk:** Animal reproduction studies have not been conducted with this combination. It is not known whether it can cause fetal harm when administered to a pregnant woman.

