- Maintain good dental hygiene (brushing and flossing) to prevent your gums from swelling, which is a common side effect.', '("Cyclosporine"[Mesh] OR "Cyclosporine"[tiab]) AND (immunosuppression OR transplantation OR adverse effects)');

