- **Children weighing 25 to <40 kg:** One 675 mg / 150 mg tablet orally once daily with food (if available in this specific formulation).
- **Children weighing <25 kg:** Safety and efficacy have not been established.', '[{"target_group": "Children and Adolescents", "min_age_months": 144, "max_age_months": 216, "dosing_type": "fixed_dose", "parameters": {"fixed_dose_mg": 800, "frequency_hours": 24, "note": "Only for patients weighing at least 40 kg."}}]', '### Renal Impairment
- **CrCl <70 mL/min:** Coadministration with tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) is not recommended due to the increased risk of renal toxicity.', '- Administer orally once daily.
