- If using the liquid drops for an infant, shake the bottle well and use the provided dropper to measure the exact dose. You can mix the drops with a small amount of water or formula.
- This medication only relieves gas symptoms; it does not prevent gas from forming. Dietary changes may be needed if symptoms persist.
- Contact your doctor if your symptoms do not improve or if you develop severe abdominal pain.', '("Simethicone"[Mesh] OR "simethicone"[tiab])');
**Electrolyte Imbalances:** Prolonged use without electrolyte supplementation can cause severe hypokalemia, hypophosphatemia, and hypomagnesemia. Monitor electrolytes and supplement as necessary.
