**Rebound Hypoglycemia:** Abrupt withdrawal of concentrated dextrose solutions can lead to severe rebound hypoglycemia due to endogenous insulin hypersecretion. Taper the infusion gradually.', '- Emergency treatment of severe hypoglycemia
