- **Accidental Ingestion:** Provide supportive care. No specific antidote is required.', 'Store at room temperature between 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F). Do not freeze.', '- Start treatment at the very first sign of a cold sore (tingling, redness, or itching) for the best results.
- Wash your hands before and after applying the cream to avoid spreading the virus to your eyes or to other people.
- Do not share the tube with anyone else, even if they have similar symptoms.
