Use with caution in patients with severe obstructive coronary artery disease, ischemic heart disease, or cerebrovascular disease, as excessive hypotension could exacerbate ischemia.
Use with caution in patients with renal artery stenosis, severe aortic stenosis, hypertrophic cardiomyopathy with outflow tract obstruction, or cardiac failure.
Monitor renal function and serum potassium closely, especially in the elderly and those with pre-existing renal impairment.
