- Do not cover the treated area with bandages or tight clothing unless your doctor tells you to.
- Do not use this medication on your face, groin, or underarms unless specifically instructed by your doctor, as the skin in these areas is thinner and more prone to side effects.
- Stop using the medication and contact your doctor if your skin condition worsens or if you notice signs of a skin infection.', '(("Hydrocortisone butyrate"[MeSH Terms] OR "Hydrocortisone butyrate"[Title/Abstract]) AND ("Administration, Topical"[MeSH Terms] OR "topical"[Title/Abstract] OR "dermal"[Title/Abstract] OR "cutaneous"[Title/Abstract]))');

