- **Supportive Care:** Discontinue the medication. Apply bland, non-comedogenic moisturizers and cold compresses to soothe irritated skin.', 'Store at controlled room temperature 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F). Protect from freezing and excessive heat.', '- Your acne may appear to get worse during the first few weeks of treatment; this is normal as the medication works on invisible lesions under the skin. Continue using it.
- Apply only a pea-sized amount for your entire face. Using more will not clear your acne faster but will cause severe peeling and redness.
