- Do not use this product on children under 2 years old, as it can cause a rare but deadly blood condition.
- Seek emergency medical help immediately if you or your child develop pale, gray, or blue-colored skin, lips, or nail beds, a headache, lightheadedness, or shortness of breath after using this product.', '("Benzocaine"[Mesh] AND "Camphor"[Mesh] AND "Menthol"[Mesh])');

