- Remove contact lenses prior to administration and wait at least 10 minutes before reinserting.', 'Overdose via the ocular route is highly unlikely to cause systemic toxicity. Accidental oral ingestion may cause mild CNS depression, somnolence, and cardiac arrhythmias in extreme cases.', '**Management Strategy:**
