  - *Maximum area 8 cm² (cannula) or 100 cm² (spray):* Use 2 mL.
  - *Maximum area 16 cm² (cannula) or 200 cm² (spray):* Use 4 mL.
  - *Maximum area 40 cm² (cannula) or 500 cm² (spray):* Use 10 mL.', '[]', 'No dosage adjustment is necessary for renal impairment, as the product is applied topically and systemic absorption is minimal.', '- **For Topical Use Only. Do not inject.**
- Dry the site as much as possible before application.
