- *Severity:* Moderate
- *Clinical Result:* High doses of folic acid may decrease serum phenytoin concentrations, risking seizure breakthrough.
- *Management:* Monitor phenytoin levels if high-dose folic acid is initiated.', '- **Prophylaxis/Dietary Supplement:** 1 capsule orally once daily.
