- *Severe Impairment or End-Stage Renal Disease (eGFR <30 mL/min/1.73 m²):* Caution should be exercised when giving glycopyrronium to patients with severe renal impairment, as systemic exposure may be increased.', '- **DPI Capsules:** Do NOT swallow capsules. Use only with the provided inhaler device. Pierce the capsule in the device and inhale deeply and rapidly.
