- 1.5 mg as a single dose as soon as possible within 72 hours of unprotected intercourse. (Efficacy decreases as time elapses; most effective if taken within 24 hours).
- *Alternative regimen:* 0.75 mg as soon as possible within 72 hours, followed by a second 0.75 mg dose 12 hours later.
- *Note:* If vomiting occurs within 2 hours of taking a dose, the dose should be repeated.

**Routine Contraception (Progestin-only pill):**
- 30 mcg or 37.5 mcg once daily at the exact same time every day. No pill-free interval.

