- Recommended dose: 1.5 mg to 3 mg once daily.', '**All Indications:**
- Children and Adolescents under 18 years: Safety and efficacy have not been established. Use is not recommended.', '[]', '- Mild to Moderate Renal Impairment (CrCl ≥30 mL/min): No dosage adjustment required.
- Severe Renal Impairment (CrCl <30 mL/min): Use is not recommended as safety and efficacy have not been established.', '- Administer orally once daily.
