**Allergic Contact Dermatitis:** Rare but serious and potentially life-threatening allergic reactions or severe irritation have been reported.', '- Topical treatment of Acne Vulgaris.', '**Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with a known hypersensitivity to erythromycin, benzoyl peroxide, or any of the excipients.', '- Dry skin and scaling
