- To prevent the medicine from entering your bloodstream and causing side effects like a fast heartbeat or high blood pressure, press your finger against the inner corner of your eye for 2-3 minutes after putting the drops in.
- Seek immediate medical attention if you experience severe eye pain, a rapid heartbeat, severe headache, or confusion.', '("Phenylephrine"[Mesh] OR "Phenylephrine"[tiab]) AND ("Tropicamide"[Mesh] OR "Tropicamide"[tiab]) AND ("Mydriatics"[Mesh] OR "Ophthalmic Solutions"[Mesh])');
