- Avoid taking omeprazole (Prilosec) or esomeprazole (Nexium) for heartburn, as they can stop clopidogrel from working properly.', '("Clopidogrel"[Mesh] OR "Clopidogrel"[tiab]) AND (acute coronary syndrome OR platelet aggregation inhibitors OR pharmacokinetics)');

**Immune Reconstitution Syndrome:** Patients may develop an inflammatory response to indolent or residual opportunistic infections (e.g., *Mycobacterium avium* complex, cytomegalovirus, *Pneumocystis jirovecii*, or tuberculosis) during the initial phase of treatment.

