  - *Children >15 kg:* Total Dose (mL) = 0.0442 × (Desired Hgb - Observed Hgb) × Lean Body Weight (kg) + (0.26 × Lean Body Weight). Desired Hgb is usually 14.8 g/dL.
- **Maximum Daily Dose:**
  - Infants <5 kg: 25 mg (0.5 mL).
