- **Monitoring:** Monitor serum iron, total iron-binding capacity (TIBC), liver function, and cardiac status closely.', 'Store at controlled room temperature 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F). Do not freeze.', 'You will receive a small test dose first to ensure you do not have a severe allergic reaction. Report any difficulty breathing, rash, itching, or dizziness immediately during or after the infusion. This medication may cause your stools to turn dark or black, which is normal.', '("Iron-Dextran Complex"[Mesh] OR "iron dextran"[tiab])');

