- Safety and efficacy not established.', '[{"target_group": "Children (2 to 16 years) - CINV", "min_age_months": 24, "max_age_months": 192, "dosing_type": "weight_based", "parameters": {"mg_per_kg_per_day_min": 1.8, "mg_per_kg_per_day_max": 1.8, "divided_doses_per_day": [1], "absolute_max_daily_dose_mg": 100, "note": "Oral administration only for CINV."}}, {"target_group": "Children (2 to 16 years) - PONV", "min_age_months": 24, "max_age_months": 192, "dosing_type": "weight_based", "parameters": {"mg_per_kg_per_day_min": 0.35, "mg_per_kg_per_day_max": 0.35, "divided_doses_per_day": [1], "absolute_max_daily_dose_mg": 12.5, "note": "Intravenous administration for PONV."}}]', 'No dosage adjustment is necessary for patients with renal impairment.', '**Intravenous Preparation:**
