- This medication helps your body use insulin better but does not cure diabetes. Continue to follow your prescribed diet and exercise plan.
- If you are a premenopausal woman who does not have regular periods, this medication may cause you to start ovulating again, increasing your chance of becoming pregnant. Use reliable birth control.
- Have your liver function checked regularly as directed by your doctor.
- Be aware of the signs of low blood sugar (sweating, shakiness, confusion), especially if you take other diabetes medications, and know how to treat it.', '("Rosiglitazone"[Mesh] OR "rosiglitazone"[tiab])');

