- **Inhalational Anthrax (Prophylaxis):** Indicated for the prophylaxis of inhalational anthrax when alternative therapies are not available or are not appropriate.', '- **Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with a known severe hypersensitivity to raxibacumab or any of its excipients.', '**1-10%**
