- **Weeping Lesions:** Helps to dry the oozing and weeping caused by irritation due to poisonous plants.', '**Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with a known history of hypersensitivity to calamine, zinc oxide, glycerin, or any of the components.', '**Common:**
