- **Ultimate Clinical Outcome:** No severe or life-threatening outcomes are expected.', '- **Management:** Wipe off excess product with a clean cloth. Wash the area with mild soap and warm water if necessary. No specific treatment is required for accidental ingestion.', 'Store at room temperature between 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F). Keep the container tightly closed. Lanolin may become thick or solid in cold temperatures; warming the tube slightly in the hands will soften it.', '- If you have a known allergy to wool, test a small amount of lanolin on your forearm before applying it to larger areas or sensitive skin.
