- **Procedural Intervention:** Paracentesis or thoracentesis may be required for severe ascites or pleural effusion causing respiratory compromise. Anticoagulation may be considered if hemoconcentration is severe to prevent thromboembolism.', '- Store refrigerated at 2°C to 8°C (36°F to 46°F) prior to dispensing.
