- **Severe:** No severe systemic toxicity has been reported with acute overdosage.', '- **Management:** Treatment is symptomatic and supportive. If an overdose occurs, the ART cycle may need to be temporarily suspended or adjusted. Monitor hormone levels and follicular development.', '- Store at controlled room temperature 25°C (77°F); excursions permitted to 15°C to 30°C (59°F to 86°F).
