- *Children ≥2 years:* Apply to the affected area not more than 3 to 4 times daily. Adult supervision is required for children under 12 years of age.
- *Children <2 years:* Contraindicated.', '[]', 'No dosage adjustment necessary. Systemic absorption is minimal.', '- For topical oral use only. Do not swallow large amounts.
