**Ultimate Outcome:** If untreated, local irritation will persist but is generally self-limiting and not life-threatening.', '- **Decontamination:** Flush the eye(s) with sterile saline or water if excessive drops are instilled.
- **Systemic Ingestion:** If accidentally ingested orally, treatment is symptomatic and supportive.', '- Store unopened foil pouches in a refrigerator at 2°C to 8°C (36°F to 46°F).
- Once the pouch is opened, the single-use containers may be stored at room temperature (up to 25°C) for up to 28 days.
