- **Systemic Overdose (Prolonged/Extensive Use):** Reversible HPA axis suppression, manifestations of Cushing''s syndrome (moon face, central obesity), hyperglycemia, and glucosuria.', '- **Management:** Discontinue the topical corticosteroid. If the drug has been used extensively or for a prolonged period, discontinue gradually (tapering) to prevent acute adrenal insufficiency. Treat symptoms supportively.', '- Store at room temperature between 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F).
