**Renal and Hepatic Impairment:** Use with caution in patients with severe renal or hepatic impairment due to potential alterations in calcium metabolism.', '- **Plaque Psoriasis:** Topical treatment of mild to moderate plaque psoriasis in adults and pediatric patients.
