- **Supportive Care:** If hypercalcemia is severe, administer intravenous fluids (normal saline) and consider loop diuretics (e.g., furosemide) to promote calcium excretion. Bisphosphonates or calcitonin may be required in refractory cases.', '- Store at room temperature between 15°C and 25°C (59°F to 77°F).
