- **Allergic Reactions:** Advise the patient to seek immediate medical attention if they develop a severe rash, swelling of the face/throat, or difficulty breathing.
- **Storage:** Remind the patient to keep the medication in the refrigerator and to let it sit at room temperature for 30-40 minutes before injecting to reduce discomfort.', '("alirocumab"[MeSH Terms] OR "alirocumab"[Title/Abstract])');

