- **CrCl 20-30 mL/min:** Administer 55% of the normal dose.
- **CrCl 10-20 mL/min:** Administer 45% of the normal dose.
- **CrCl 5-10 mL/min:** Administer 40% of the normal dose.', '- **IV Preparation:** Reconstitute the 15 Unit vial with 5 mL (or 30 Unit vial with 10 mL) of 0.9% Sodium Chloride (NS) to yield 3 Units/mL. Do NOT use dextrose-containing diluents.
