**Supportive Care:** Aggressive fluid resuscitation, correction of acid-base abnormalities, and supportive care for shock and GI bleeding.', 'Store at room temperature. Protect from light and moisture. Keep strictly out of reach of children.', 'This medication is best absorbed on an empty stomach, but if it upsets your stomach, you can take it with a small amount of food. Avoid taking it with dairy products, tea, or coffee. Your stools may turn dark green or black; this is a normal and harmless side effect of iron supplements. If using a liquid form, use a straw to prevent staining your teeth. Keep this medication out of the reach of children, as an overdose can be fatal.', '("Ferrous Sulfate"[Mesh] OR "ferrous sulfate"[tiab] OR "ferrous sulphate"[tiab])');
