**Systemic Absorption:** Although administered topically, systemic absorption can occur. Caution is advised in patients with a history of hypersensitivity to other H1-antihistamines.', '- **Allergic Conjunctivitis:** Indicated for the treatment of ocular itching associated with allergic conjunctivitis. It provides rapid relief of symptoms by stabilizing mast cells and blocking histamine receptors.', '- **Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with a known hypersensitivity to olopatadine or any component of the formulation, as allergic reactions including anaphylaxis can occur.', '- **Headache:** Mild to moderate headache following instillation.
