- **Systemic Absorption:** If applied to massive areas of damaged skin, potential for nephrotoxicity (elevated BUN/creatinine) and ototoxicity (hearing loss, tinnitus).', '- **Immediate Management:** Wash the affected area thoroughly with soap and water to remove unabsorbed medication.
- **Systemic Toxicity:** If systemic toxicity is suspected due to massive absorption, monitor renal function and auditory status. Provide supportive care. Discontinue the medication immediately.', '- Store at room temperature (15°C to 30°C).
