- No specific antidote is required.', '- Storage requirements vary by specific strain and formulation. Many require refrigeration (2°C to 8°C) to maintain viability, while some are shelf-stable at room temperature (below 25°C). Protect from moisture and direct sunlight.', '- To get the most benefit, take this supplement at least 2 hours apart from any antibiotic medications.
