- **Tetracyclines and Fluoroquinolones:** Minerals (calcium, iron, zinc, magnesium) can chelate these antibiotics, significantly reducing their gastrointestinal absorption. *Management:* Administer the antibiotic at least 2 hours before or 4-6 hours after the multivitamin.
