**Severe:** There is limited experience with acute overdose. Even at doses of 100 mg IV, no serious adverse effects were observed in healthy volunteers. The primary risk is the precipitation of severe withdrawal symptoms or seizures in benzodiazepine-dependent patients.', '**Management Strategy:**
