**Clinical Considerations:** Do not exceed the recommended daily allowance (RDA) for Vitamin A during pregnancy, as excessive doses are highly teratogenic.', 'Safe for use during lactation when taken at recommended doses. Provides essential nutrients for both mother and infant.', '{"trimester_1": "Safe", "trimester_2": "Safe", "trimester_3": "Safe"}', 'Provides a comprehensive array of essential water-soluble and fat-soluble vitamins required for normal metabolic functions, tissue repair, and immune response.', '["B-Complex Vitamins act as essential coenzymes in carbohydrate, protein, and fat metabolism, facilitating energy production.", "Vitamin C promotes collagen synthesis, tissue repair, and enhances immune system function.", "Vitamin D regulates calcium homeostasis, promoting bone mineralization.", "Vitamin A is essential for the function of the retina and the growth and differentiation of epithelial tissue.", "Vitamin E acts as an antioxidant, neutralizing free radicals and protecting cellular membranes from oxidative damage."]', '**Moderate:**
