- **Concurrent Ergot Alkaloids:** Contraindicated with ergotamine or dihydroergotamine due to the risk of severe peripheral ischemia (ergotism).', '- **Common:** Nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain, diarrhoea, dyspepsia, flatulence, weakness, malaise, headache, dizziness.
