- Advise that this medication does not protect against HIV or other sexually transmitted infections (STIs).
- Warn about the signs of serious cardiovascular events (ACHES: Abdominal pain, Chest pain, Headaches, Eye problems, Severe leg pain) and instruct to seek immediate medical attention if they occur.
