**Accidental Ingestion:** Swallowing small amounts of 0.9% sodium chloride is harmless.', '**Supportive Care:** No specific treatment is required. Wipe away excess fluid.', '- Store at room temperature, away from direct heat and light.
- Keep the container tightly closed.
- Discard the bottle 4 weeks after opening to prevent microbial contamination.', '- Reassure parents that saline drops are a safe, drug-free way to help infants breathe easier when they have a cold, especially before feeding.
