- **Electrolyte Imbalance:** Contraindicated in patients with hypokalemia, which predisposes to Torsades de Pointes.
- **Concurrent CYP Inhibitors:** Contraindicated with systemic macrolide antibiotics (e.g., erythromycin) and imidazole antifungals (e.g., ketoconazole) due to the risk of elevated mizolastine levels and fatal arrhythmias.', '- Dry mouth
