- **Psychotropic Drugs:** Concurrent use may worsen constipation associated with iron therapy.
- **ACE Inhibitors:** Increased systemic side effects have been reported with concomitant ACE inhibitors and parenteral iron administration, though less likely with oral forms.', '**Nutritional Deficiency**
