- 3 g orally 3 hours before surgery. The dose may be repeated once, 24 hours after surgery.', 'Safety and efficacy in pediatric patients below the age of 12 years have not been established. Not recommended for use in this population.', '[]', '- *Mild to Moderate Impairment (CrCl >10 mL/min):* No dosage adjustment needed.
