**Lactation:**
Safe for use. If applied to the breast area, wash thoroughly prior to breastfeeding.', '{"trimester_1": "Safe", "trimester_2": "Safe", "trimester_3": "Safe"}', 'Topical urea acts as a humectant and keratolytic agent, increasing skin hydration and dissolving the intercellular matrix of the stratum corneum.', '["Urea is a natural component of the skin''s moisturizing factor.", "When applied topically, it increases the water-binding capacity of the stratum corneum, promoting hydration.", "At higher concentrations, it exhibits keratolytic properties by altering the structure of keratin and dissolving the intercellular matrix.", "This softens hyperkeratotic areas, facilitates the shedding of dry, scaly skin, and relieves pruritus."]', '**Other Topical Agents (e.g., Corticosteroids, 5-Fluorouracil):**
