**Local Irritation:** Avoid contact with eyes, mucous membranes, and broken or severely inflamed skin. Discontinue use if severe burning, stinging, or worsening of the skin condition occurs.', '- **Skin Moisturization:** Routine care for dry, rough, or scaly skin.
