2. **Systemic Toxicity:** Seek immediate medical attention for supportive care and monitoring of acid-base balance.', 'Store at room temperature, away from excessive heat and direct sunlight. Keep container tightly closed.', 'Apply only to acne-prone areas, not the entire face. It is normal to experience mild tingling or peeling initially. If your skin becomes excessively dry or irritated, reduce the frequency of application. Use a non-comedogenic moisturizer and sunscreen during the day.', '(("Salicylic Acid"[mh] OR "Salicylic Acid"[tiab]) AND ("topical"[tiab] OR "dermal"[tiab] OR "cutaneous"[tiab]))');

