- **Iron Toxicity:** Administer Deferoxamine (an iron chelator) intravenously for severe iron poisoning.
- **Supportive Care:** Provide aggressive IV fluid resuscitation and symptomatic management.', 'Store at room temperature in a dry place. Keep the bottle tightly closed and out of reach of children.', '- Take this vitamin with a meal to prevent an upset stomach.
- This supplement contains iron, which may cause your stools to turn dark green or black; this is normal and harmless.
- Do not take this vitamin at the same time as antibiotics or thyroid medications. Separate them by at least 2 hours.
