- **Fibromyalgia:** Initiate at 30 mg once daily for 1 week, then increase to 60 mg once daily. Maximum dose: 60 mg/day.
- **Chronic Musculoskeletal Pain:** Initiate at 30 mg once daily for 1 week, then increase to 60 mg once daily. Maximum dose: 60 mg/day.', '- **Generalized Anxiety Disorder (7 to 17 years):** Initiate at 30 mg once daily. After 2 weeks, consider increasing to the target dose of 60 mg once daily based on clinical response and tolerability. Maximum dose: 120 mg/day.
