**Renal Impairment:** Contraindicated in acute or chronic renal insufficiency, anuria, or diabetic nephropathy due to the high risk of rapid hyperkalemia.

**Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with known hypersensitivity to amiloride, hydrochlorothiazide, or other sulfonamide-derived drugs.', '- Hyperkalemia (due to amiloride) or Hypokalemia (due to HCTZ)
