- **Ingestion:** Provide supportive care. Do not induce vomiting. Monitor for gastrointestinal symptoms and maintain hydration.', '- Store at room temperature (20°C to 25°C).
- Keep the tube tightly closed.', '- Clean and dry the rectal area gently before applying the medication.
