- Maintain a high-fiber diet and adequate fluid intake to help manage hemorrhoid symptoms.', '("Pramoxine"[Mesh] OR "Pramoxine"[tiab]) AND ("Mineral Oil"[Mesh] OR "Mineral Oil"[tiab]) AND ("Zinc Oxide"[Mesh] OR "Zinc Oxide"[tiab]) AND ("Administration, Rectal"[Mesh] OR "rectal"[tiab])');
**CNS Depression:** Dextromethorphan may cause sedation. Use with caution in patients who are sedated, debilitated, or confined to a supine position.
