- Relief of chest congestion by loosening phlegm and thinning bronchial secretions to make coughs more productive.
- Temporary relief of minor throat irritation.', '- **MAOI Therapy:** Contraindicated during or within 14 days of taking monoamine oxidase inhibitors (MAOIs) due to the risk of severe, potentially fatal serotonin syndrome (hyperpyrexia, hallucinations, gross myoclonus, cardiovascular collapse).
- **Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with documented hypersensitivity to dextromethorphan, guaifenesin, menthol, or any excipients.
