Breastfeeding is strictly contraindicated during therapy and for at least one week after the final dose due to the risk of severe toxicity to the infant.', '{"trimester_1": "Contraindicated", "trimester_2": "Contraindicated", "trimester_3": "Contraindicated"}', 'Alpelisib is a targeted kinase inhibitor that specifically blocks phosphatidylinositol-3-kinase alpha (PI3K-alpha), halting tumor cell proliferation in PIK3CA-mutated cancers.', '["Alpelisib is a targeted kinase inhibitor that specifically blocks phosphatidylinositol-3-kinase alpha (PI3K-alpha).", "It inhibits the phosphorylation of downstream targets in the PI3K pathway, including Akt.", "In breast cancer cells with PIK3CA mutations, this inhibition halts hyperactive PI3K/Akt signaling.", "The blockade of this pathway reduces cellular proliferation, induces apoptosis, and, when combined with fulvestrant, overcomes endocrine resistance in ER-positive breast cancers."]', '**Serious**
