**Local Irritation:** Discontinue use if sensitization or severe local irritation occurs.
**Systemic Absorption:** Systemic absorption following topical application is minimal; however, caution is advised if applied to large areas of broken or severely inflamed skin.', '- Treatment and prophylaxis of dandruff (Pityriasis capitis).
