- Swallow tablets whole; do not crush or chew.', '**Clinical Presentation:**
Due to negligible systemic absorption, systemic toxicity from an overdose is highly unlikely. Expected effects would be limited to local gastrointestinal disturbances (e.g., severe constipation, nausea).

