- **Specific Antidote:** Initiate Intravenous Lipid Emulsion (ILE) therapy (e.g., 20% lipid emulsion) immediately for severe cardiovascular toxicity or cardiac arrest, following established LAST (Local Anesthetic Systemic Toxicity) protocols. Continue CPR; prolonged resuscitation may be required.', '- Store at room temperature (20°C to 25°C).
