- **Surgical Prophylaxis:** Prevention of perioperative infections in contaminated or potentially contaminated procedures.', '**Hypersensitivity:** Contraindicated in patients with a known allergy to cefotaxime, other cephalosporins, or any component of the formulation. Use with extreme caution in patients with a history of severe IgE-mediated penicillin allergy.', '**Local:** Injection site pain, induration, phlebitis (with IV administration).
