- **Ophthalmic:** Instill 1 to 2 drops into the affected eye(s) 3 to 4 times a day, or as needed. Dosing is the same as for adults.', '[]', 'No dosage adjustment is required. The drug is not systemically absorbed.', '- Wash hands thoroughly before use.
